From ea520eb5bfec331ed8a5ab4b6c3427cc0ceda6d8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Noam Lessner <nlessner@habana.ai>
Date: Wed, 29 Jan 2020 00:57:58 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-8228] goya2: spi_flash: read security fuse from flash

Add support to read the key hash, revoked keys and fw security version
from spi flash location

Change-Id: I38fd200630a604694f5ebbcb8560e2ac806044f2
---

